    "\\(\\rho_{XY}=\\frac{\\mathrm{Cov}(X,Y)}{\\sqrt{DX}\\sqrt{DY}}=\\frac{\\sigma^2/8}{\\sigma\\cdot\\sigma/2}=\\frac14\\)。",
    "选 \\(C\\)。"
